  "instrument": {
    "name": "Raise-to-play lift demo",
    "description": "A compact 1-string plucked instrument on direct GPIO (no PCA) that demonstrates the raise-to-play lift (pluck.liftEngage = raiseToPlay): at rest the strum lift holds the plectrum down ON the string (an idle string is muted); a Note On raises it to play, it stays up for the whole note, then falls back onto the string at Note Off to mute — the lift is the damper, no separate mute needed.",
